New in 0.13:
• One upgrade tree: over 100 upgrades in six branches, bought with your cash from the farmhouse, Sundown or the Barn
• Most of them work now: lightning, bees, a farm dog, a ghost sickle, cashback on bills and many more
• Big upgrades take time to build; an optional ad finishes one
• Reset the tree for free and choose again
• Diamonds are gone: your skills are in the tree and your diamonds became tree credit
